    "description": "Stripe retried refund webhooks during the 2 August incident and we recorded the refund twice for 14 orders (MER-2231).\n\nThis adds an EventClaim guard: handlers claim the Stripe event id in webhook_events before they touch the ledger, so a retried delivery is a no-op. The unique index on webhook_events.event_id already exists, so there is no migration.\n\nI will follow up with a backfill for the 14 affected orders.",
    "generated_by": "precis 0.1.0",
    "generated_at": "2026-08-08T09:14:22Z"
  },
